WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:02.083
This is just like the other ones, 

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:04.125
but I didn't send it to you.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:11.166
How many of these boxes did you create? 

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.916
Five. One for each of my friends. 

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.208
No test boxes, no prototypes?

00:00:15.583 --> 00:00:17.541
My puzzle guy barely 
got the five done in time,

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:19.041
and he apprenticed with Ricky Jay.

00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:21.666
And once the boxes are open
 and the puzzles completed,

00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:24.916
is there any way to close them again?
 To reset them?

00:00:26.583 --> 00:00:29.000
Hang on. Hang on. 

00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:32.375
Someone reset the box. 

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.208
Someone reset the box. 

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.458
They sent it to you as a gag. 

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:38.458
“Miles is doing a murder mystery. 

00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:40.875
Let's invite Benoit freaking Blanc.”

00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:43.166
Oh, it's so good.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:46.916
I am mortified. I don't--

00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:47.583
Why?

00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:51.125
I've got the predefinite detective
 in the world at my murder mystery party.

00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.833
That is so legit. 

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:57.166
Mr. Bron, I've learned through
 bitter experience

00:00:57.541 --> 00:01:00.291
that an anonymous invitation
 is not to be trifled with.

00:01:00.375 --> 00:01:03.708
Okay, look, come on. I'd love to
 have you visit me in my home.

00:01:04.875 --> 00:01:06.208
There, you've been invited. 

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:07.875
You're an official guest now. 

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:08.750
Thrilled to have you. 

00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:11.291
I mean, relax. Enjoy yourself.

00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:15.083
Hey, try to solve
 the murder mystery if you can.

00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:18.416
I don't want to toot my own horn,
 but it's pretty next level.

00:01:19.041 --> 00:01:20.333
I'm going to foil.
 I'll see you at the pool.

